join Zanele (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Zanele (Worried)
- It's done
	Hope: It's done.
	Zanele: It is done.
	Zanele: I have been in here four times since Thursday. Each time to check something I had already checked.
	Zanele: There is a great deal to do before Saturday. Chairs, mostly — we have forty-one children and about twenty-six chairs, so we are borrowing, and borrowed chairs must go back to the right houses.
	Zanele: And someone must tell the outlying households. Not everyone comes past the post drum.
	set {GameState.quest_zanele_schoolhouse_opening} = "active"
	[signal arg="objective:Help with the opening — borrow and arrange seating, decorate, spread word"]
